// appear() and vanish() give objects a lifetime — and queries respect it.
// The wall vanishes at t=2: watch the sight line open at that exact moment.
// The pink ball doesn't exist until t=3; until then, questions about it
// have no answer.

sphere eye  r(0.3) at(-4 0.5 0) color(gold)
box target  size(0.6 0.6 0.6) at(4 0.3 0) color(tomato)
box wall    size(0.3 2 3) at(0 1 0) vanish(2) color(#5b6575)
sphere late r(0.3) at(0 0.3 2) appear(3) color(hotpink)

? sees(eye target)
? distance(eye late)
